---
layout: page.njk
title: Appointments and contact us online
lede: You can contact us online, through the app, or by phone.
---
{% from "nhsuk/components/action-link/macro.njk" import actionLink %}
{% from "nhsuk/components/card/macro.njk" import card %}
{% set oc = practice.online_services.online_consultation %}

{{ card({
  variant: "emergency",
  heading: "Call 999 or go to A&E now if:",
  descriptionHtml: "<p>it's a life-threatening emergency. Do not use our online form or wait for a call back.</p>"
}) }}

<h2>{{ oc.label or "Contact us online" }}</h2>
<p>Use our online form to ask for an appointment, get medical advice, or help with things like fit notes and letters.</p>
{% if oc.availability %}<p>The online form is available {{ oc.availability }}.</p>{% endif %}
{{ actionLink({ text: oc.label or "Contact us online", href: oc.url }) }}

{% if oc.embed_html %}
  <div class="app-embed" data-embed="online-consultation">
    {{ oc.embed_html | safe }}
  </div>
{% endif %}

<p class="nhsuk-body-s">The online form is provided by {{ oc.provider }} on our behalf.</p>

{% if practice.online_services.nhs_app %}
<h2>Use the {{ practice.nhs_app_link.name }}</h2>
<p>You can use the <a href="{{ practice.nhs_app_link.url }}">{{ practice.nhs_app_link.name }}</a> to book some appointments, order repeat prescriptions and see your health record.</p>
{% endif %}

<h2>Call us</h2>
<p>Call <a href="{{ practice.phone_link }}">{{ practice.phone_display }}</a>. Phone lines are open {{ practice.contact.phone_hours }}.</p>
<p>If you cannot use our online form, our reception team will fill it in for you over the phone.</p>

<h2>Cancelling an appointment</h2>
<p>If you cannot make your appointment, please tell us as soon as possible so we can offer it to someone else. You can cancel in the {{ practice.nhs_app_link.name }} or by calling us.</p>
